---
Draw live ADSR envelope visualization in synth editor.

Show the attack/decay/sustain/release curve as a canvas graphic.
Updates in real-time as the user adjusts ADSR parameters.

## Design
- Canvas area ~200x60px in synth editor
- X-axis: time (attack + decay + sustain_hold + release)
- Y-axis: amplitude (0 to 1)
- Draw polyline: (0,0) -> (A, 1.0) -> (A+D, S) -> (A+D+hold, S) -> (A+D+hold+R, 0)
- Fill under the curve with semi-transparent color
- Vertical lines at phase boundaries

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] ADSR curve drawn correctly for all presets
- [ ] Updates live as sliders are adjusted
- [ ] Handles edge cases: zero attack, zero decay, sustain=1.0, zero release
- [ ] Visible in both standalone and plugin GUI

## Test Plan
- [ ] Visual: curve matches expected shape for known ADSR values
- [ ] Visual: real-time update while dragging sliders
